                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Bierzerkers had a funny idea with drunken Vikings beating the hell out of each other, but the actual game just wasn’t very good. The combat felt clunky and repetitive, and once the playerbase disappeared there really wasn’t much left to do anyway. It had some personality, but that wasn’t enough to keep it fun. Easy one to pass on.\n",
